{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act53side_level_act53side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act53side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act53side_level_act53side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TO-2","storyName":"记新友的混乱","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"车后座的物资箱里突然传出干呕声，原来里面藏着一个人——是趁乱逃跑的嘉辛塔！几人暂且来到了洋蓟村落脚，村口的通讯塔上似乎有什么东西……好像也是个人？！","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act53side/level_act53side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act53side_02","minState":"UNLOCKED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["安洁莉娜","塔妮","？？？","物资箱？","衣着体面的少女","安洁莉娜&塔妮","嘉辛塔","慌张的少女","愤怒的村民","不满的村民","好事的村民","看戏的村民"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_bg_76_g2_wildhighway_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"70_g2_tjlibrary","duration":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleTo":"1.3","yFrom":"-50","yTo":"-50","block":"false","id":7},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.11","fadetime":"0.1","id":8},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.11","fadetime":"0.1","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_driveincar","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"car","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_noisycitytraffic","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"n","id":11},{"type":"backgroundtween","duration":"2","yFrom":"-50","yTo":"50","xTo":"-20","block":"false","id":12},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":16},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_land_impact","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":18},{"type":"backgroundtween","duration":"0.3","yFrom":"50","yTo":"0","xTo":"0","block":"false","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":20},{"type":"backgroundtween","duration":"0.3","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-20","block":"false","id":21},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"1","to":"0.6","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":23},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"0.4","ystrength":"0.4","vibrato":"10","randomness":"10","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":24},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"car","fadetime":"2","id":25},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"n","fadetime":"2","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#11$2","posfrom":"0,60","posto":"0,60","focus":"l","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#12$1","posfrom":"30,60","posto":"30,60","focus":"l","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"糟了，没控制好源石技艺的方向，车在空中转了太多圈了！","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"虽然车后座的物资箱应该没有受影响，但……塔妮，你还好吗？","id":32},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_comedy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":33,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#12$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"不……","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#8$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"不舒服？快，我这里有晕车药！","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"不……不是还好，是非常好，特别特别好！这是我十八年来最好的一天！这才是探险，这才是我想要的人生！哇，太刺激了！","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#16$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"l","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"呃……你没有不舒服就好，之前我练习源石技艺的时候，陪我练习的干员就会晕车，一般转个三圈就会吐了。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"哕——","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#20$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"l","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"对对对，就是这个声音——","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-20$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#12$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"l","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"欸？哪儿来的声音？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":50},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hvycarbrake","volume":"1","id":51},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"0.4","ystrength":"0.4","vibrato":"10","randomness":"10","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":52},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleTo":"1.5","yScaleTo":"1.5","duration":"1","block":"false","id":53},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_bg_76_g2_wildhighway_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","fadetime":"1","id":54},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"car","fadetime":"1","id":55},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"n","fadetime":"1","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":57},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"0.6","to":"0","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#11$2","posfrom":"0,60","posto":"0,60","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#12$1","posfrom":"30,60","posto":"30,60","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#12$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我来找！奶奶说过，我的耳朵虽然小但是可灵了！","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#4$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"（竖起耳朵）","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"哕——","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"在物资箱里！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"物资箱？","text":"别打开！我是荒地里最凶猛的有袋鼷兽！我会把你们全吃了！","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"哇，好可怕耶。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#15$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"l","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"哇，好可怕耶。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"物资箱？","text":"……你们听上去也太敷衍了。最起码得——哕……","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"l","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"有袋鼷兽不会吃人也不会晕车，出来吧，陌生的小姐。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":82},{"type":"charslot","id":83},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","volume":"1","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":85},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenbox_apple_overturn","volume":"1","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,-150","posto":"0,-80","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着体面的少女","text":"唔……自我介绍一会儿再说，先、先给我一片晕车药……","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"curtain","id":95},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_34_g10_tent_inside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#8$2","focus":"all","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2","focus":"all","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜&塔妮","text":"什么？你是雷姆必拓知名矿业大亨坎贝尔先生的千金——嘉辛塔·坎贝尔？","id":102},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"charslot","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"呼——罗德岛的信使小姐，你带的花草茶真不错。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","id":107},{"type":"multiline","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"谢谢，这是我们的干员莱娜小姐在我出门前塞给我的，具有稳定心神的效果——","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#3$2","id":109},{"type":"multiline","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"不对，话题扯远了……","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$2","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"你为什么躲在我的越野车物资箱里？","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-22$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"哎呀，还不是因为我的父母只允许我在大涌泉镇周边度假！","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"那儿是出了名的度假地，我都去过多少次了，连间歇泉的喷发时间都背出来了……","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"所以我就用了点小手段从保镖手里逃出来，自己找乐子咯。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$2","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"你说的小手段是指溜进我的物资箱吗？","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-22$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"你说的保镖是头盔姐安珀和路障哥皮塔的同伙吗？","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"什么跟什么呀……","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"所以我在大涌泉镇内和镇门口看到的黑衣人都是嘉辛塔你的保镖，也就是说现在回大涌泉镇也不会有人找塔妮麻烦，那——","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"——欸欸欸嘉辛塔！既然你的保镖现在正在大涌泉镇找你，我们是不是不该现在就回去呀？","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"那当然！我好不容易才逃出来的，没人能把我送回去！","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"再说我家在南边的大铁屯，我度假的时间也结束了，也该回家去了。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#5$2","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"可既然那些人不是坏人，是受雇于你父母的保镖——","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"不不不不不不，安洁莉娜，你可不知道我父母对我有多过度保护。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"连我过个马路那些保镖都要组成人墙把人行横道隔开的，和他们在一起我就什么都做不了了！","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"哎呀，安洁莉娜，看来我们不得不往南继续走啦！","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"……","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"反正现在也没有离大涌泉镇太远，嘉辛塔可以等在这里，塔妮我先把你送回去。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#11$2","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"这怎么行！这儿可是荒郊野外，距离大涌泉镇来回至少两个小时，把坎贝尔先生的千金一个人留在这儿怎么行！","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#3$2","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"不行吗？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"我……不行吗？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#11$2","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"当、当然不行！因……因为……","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$jealous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_jealous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":151,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我听奶奶说过，零号公路上没有路灯，一到夜晚，行人的帐篷就会变成荒野里唯一的光源。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"对于行人而言，这是赶了一天路之后应得的慰藉，但，对于荒野中狂暴的牙兽群而言，也是如此……","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"（咽口水）","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#4$2","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嘉辛塔小姐，你有想过吗？为什么我们从来没有在路边见到任何一个行人，任何一顶帐篷？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#5$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"为……为什么……","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2","id":161},{"type":"multiline","name":"塔妮","text":"牙兽吃东西，","id":162},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.5","yScaleTo":"1.5","duration":"0","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.5","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":164},{"type":"multiline","name":"塔妮","text":"可是从来不吐骨头的呀。","id":165},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.8","yScaleFrom":"1.8","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"0","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"……","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":169},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slip","volume":"1","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.3","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":173},{"type":"charslot","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#15$2","focus":"r","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","posfrom":"-180,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"r","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"罗德岛的信使，我、我聘请你保护我的安全！尤其是夜晚，不能离开我们的帐篷！","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#15$2","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"唉……塔妮，你别吓嘉辛塔了。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#11$2","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"那、那你还要把我送回去吗？","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":184},{"type":"charslot","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#15$2","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"我会沿公路向南边开，在下一个村镇停下，把嘉辛塔安顿在那里，然后送你回家。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"charslot","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"（小声）那就到时候再说。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"什么？","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"charslot","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#17$2","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我是说，绝对没问题！","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-17$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"charslot","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"唉……","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_bg_76_g1_wildhighway_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":211},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0.6","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.11","fadetime":"0.1","id":213},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.11","fadetime":"0.1","id":214},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_driveincar","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"car","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_noisycitytraffic","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"n","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":217},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"0.4","ystrength":"0.4","vibrato":"10","randomness":"10","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":218},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"car","fadetime":"2","id":219},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"n","fadetime":"2","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","posfrom":"20,60","posto":"20,60","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,60","posto":"50,60","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":226},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$RimBillitonDaily_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_rimbillitondaily_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":227,"musicid":2},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"car","fadetime":"2","id":228},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"n","fadetime":"2","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"零号公路的瓶树~肚子里全是水~♪","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#4$1","posfrom":"0,70","posto":"0,70","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"全是水——！","id":237},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"charslot","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","posfrom":"20,60","posto":"20,60","focus":"r","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"r","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#17$1","posfrom":"50,60","posto":"50,60","focus":"r","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"r","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"装满源石的矿车~千万不要过热~♪","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#4$1","posfrom":"0,70","posto":"0,70","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"会爆炸——！","id":249},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"charslot","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","posfrom":"20,60","posto":"20,60","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"r","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#3$1","posfrom":"50,60","posto":"50,60","focus":"r","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"r","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"卡特斯的耳朵~不怕被风吹歪~♪","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#4$1","posfrom":"0,70","posto":"0,70","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"哦呜哦——！","id":261},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#3$1","posfrom":"50,60","posto":"50,60","focus":"l","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"l","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#20$2","posfrom":"20,60","posto":"20,60","focus":"l","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"l","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"……","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-20$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"安洁莉娜，你怎么不跟我们一起唱！","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#15$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"l","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"你唱之前都说了，这首歌谣是雷姆必拓人的童年回忆，我又不会……","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"对哦，我们现在的感觉太像同学们的毕业旅行了，搞得我都忘了你是叙拉古人。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1","posfrom":"0,70","posto":"0,70","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"叙拉古人又有什么关系？曲调很简单的，你跟我学嘛——","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#4$1","posfrom":"0,70","posto":"0,70","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"哦呜哦——！","id":282},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"charslot","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,60","posto":"50,60","focus":"l","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"l","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#14$2","posfrom":"20,60","posto":"20,60","focus":"l","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"l","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"……哦……呜哦……","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"charslot","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,70","posto":"0,70","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"大声一点，要唱出为自己的长耳朵骄傲的气势！","id":294},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"charslot","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#14$2","posfrom":"20,60","posto":"20,60","focus":"r","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"r","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#18$1","posfrom":"50,60","posto":"50,60","focus":"r","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"r","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"短耳朵也值得骄傲！","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":302},{"type":"charslot","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,70","posto":"0,70","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"那就唱出不管耳朵长什么样都很骄傲的气势，哦呜哦——！","id":306},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"charslot","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#18$1","posfrom":"50,60","posto":"50,60","focus":"l","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"l","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#21$2","posfrom":"20,60","posto":"20,60","focus":"l","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"l","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"哦呜哦——！","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-21$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#17$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"哈哈哈，好耶，安洁也会唱我们的歌了！","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"l","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"噗……好啦，快看地图塔妮，你不是说你精通探路者的理论知识吗，看看我们是不是快到了？","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"好！","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"咳咳，各位请注意！我们刚才经过的是零号公路上不著名的小景点，也是我奶奶给我讲过的地方——由源石结晶组成的源石森林！","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#15$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"根据我缜密的计算，距离我们最近的村镇洋蓟村就在前方一、二、三、四个手指宽，没错，就是四百米。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"r","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"洋蓟村虽然距离大涌泉镇不是很远，但因为地势的关系这座人口不多的小村子里也建了一座远程通讯塔，应该很显眼——","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","focus":"l","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"哦！我好像看到前面的通讯塔了，上面……","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":328},{"type":"charslot","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","posfrom":"0,70","posto":"0,70","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"上面好像有什么东西在动？","id":332},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":333},{"type":"dialog","id":334},{"type":"charslot","id":335},{"type":"text","text":"三人纷纷眯起眼来，试图看清远处正在摇晃的影子。","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","posfrom":"20,60","posto":"20,60","focus":"r","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"r","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$1","posfrom":"50,60","posto":"50,60","focus":"r","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"r","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"好像塔上有一个人，还在喊着什么……","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"verticalslider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"curtain","id":345},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0","xstrength":"0.4","ystrength":"0.4","vibrato":"10","randomness":"10","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":346},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0.6","to":"0","block":"true","id":347},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"n","fadetime":"1","id":348},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"car","fadetime":"1","id":349},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_bg_31_g4_mini12_village.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":350},{"type":"backgroundtween","duration":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleTo":"1.3","yTo":"40","block":"false","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"verticalslider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":353},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":354,"musicid":3},{"type":"text","text":"几分钟前","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#6$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"你们别过来……再过来，我就要动手了！","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"你的车把我家的墙都撞烂了，我家客厅现在有一半是你的引擎盖！","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不满的村民","text":"别再往后退了，你快撞到我们的胡萝卜架了！这可是我晒得最好的一批胡萝卜干，别把它们弄掉了！","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1185_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#8$1","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"墙的事情真的很对不起，我会想办法补偿……但这个建筑真的不是胡萝卜架，是我们公司造的通讯塔！","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"它们可是支撑了零号公路沿线区域长达九个月的远程通讯，直到……直到两个月前的技术事故才断连了……","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"可里面那两个人走的时候跟我们说了，这东西以后归我们管，拿来晾东西完全没问题！","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"啊？！","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"里面的人是这么说的？","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"当然了！大家都记得清清楚楚！","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"最早一帮人跑到这附近敲敲打打，建了这么一座塔，也不知道是干什么用的。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"塔建好了，就有两个人每天来塔里轮班，脾气一看就臭得很，干什么的我们也不敢问。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"两个月前，两人气冲冲地走了。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"他们走之前我大着胆子问他们，这座塔到底是干什么的。他们说：“你们爱干什么干什么！归你们管理，晒你们的胡萝卜去吧！”","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"之后他们就再也没回来！","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#3$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"（完了完了完了……这下彻底讲不明白了……）","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"（怎么办怎么办，又……又要往下一个通讯塔站点逃吗？可是……）","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":381},{"type":"charslot","id":382},{"type":"text","text":"眼前的阿纳缇越退越后，眼看她身上的设备就要把背后晒得金黄的胡萝卜干扫落。","id":383},{"type":"text","text":"着急的村民们赶紧拿出长长的自制农具打算给胡萝卜干换个位置，然而这一举动在慌张的少女看来等同于“进攻”无疑。","id":384},{"type":"text","text":"而事到如今，能走的路只有一条——","id":385},{"type":"text","text":"阿纳缇心一横，噌噌噌地爬上了通讯塔。","id":386},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_climbmetalladder","volume":"1","id":388},{"type":"backgroundtween","duration":"3","yTo":"-40","block":"false","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"3.3","id":390},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_bg_31_g4_mini12_village.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":391},{"type":"backgroundtween","duration":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleTo":"1.3","yTo":"40","block":"false","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不满的村民","text":"嘿！对你客气一点，你还真顺杆儿爬了！你每一步都有可能踩着我们这季度的收成，你可赔不起！","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1185_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":396},{"type":"charslot","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"我、我不会再逃了！我一定要把洋蓟村的通讯塔修好，谁劝都没有用！","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不满的村民","text":"快点下来，每天的日照时间都是很宝贵的！为了占到胡萝卜架上最好的位置，我可是跟邻居比了一个月“抓尾巴”。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1185_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不满的村民","text":"我们家已经连续五年晒出整个洋蓟村最好吃的胡萝卜干了，让你一个哭唧唧的孩子搅黄了算什么事儿啊！","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1185_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":402},{"type":"charslot","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"我、我不会下来的，我本来就恐高，一旦爬上来了，不修好塔我是绝对不会下来的！但、但是……","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"但是什么？","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":407},{"type":"charslot","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"好可怕啊呜呜呜，救……救命，救命啊！","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"你还喊救命？像话吗！","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"明明你才是那个喊着“通讯塔！通讯塔！”开车撞进村里的可疑人士，现在搞得好像是我们不讲理一样！","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":413},{"type":"charslot","id":414},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hvycarbrake","volume":"1","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":416},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cardoorc","volume":"1","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":418},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0.8","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2","posfrom":"130,0","posto":"130,0","duration":"0.8","id":421},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","duration":"0.8","id":422},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":423},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"你们这么多人欺负一个女孩子算什么？太不讲理了，放下你们的武器！","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"虽然我不像奶奶那样精通源石技艺，但我早就预见了路上会遇到需要帮助别人的情况！背包里的应急喷雾可不少，足够对付你们了！","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":428},{"type":"charslot","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的少女","text":"呜呜呜，救救我！我、我只是来工作的啊，我再也不要工作了呜呜——！","id":430},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"别再喊了！我就说你这样叫会被别人误会的，我们洋蓟村的名声啊啊！","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不满的村民","text":"你们是从哪儿来的，骑士小说看多了？","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1185_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":435},{"type":"charslot","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"各位先不要激动。我是路过的罗德岛信使，她们是顺路搭车的同伴。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"我们都从大涌泉镇来，那里也是零号公路远程通讯网络最北端的站点，我们可以证明各位的“晒胡萝卜架”确实也有远程通讯的功能。","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"如果你们怀疑这名正哭得撕心裂肺的女孩的身份……嘉辛塔？","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,0","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"坎贝尔家跟远程通讯的研发公司——纵贯红土公司有合作关系，那女孩身上的设备上都有他们公司的标志。","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"而且纵贯红土公司为了垄断整个远程通讯产业，在宣传上下了不少功夫，标志也用特殊的涂层处理过。","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#7$1","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"既然我们能在那么远的距离看到这个女孩身上的标志，那一定是纵贯红土公司的人没错！","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"既然如此，这就是纵贯红土公司派遣的工程师，不是什么可疑人士，各位也不用太紧张。","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"按照常理来说，只要一座通讯塔修好，洋蓟村和周边村镇的通讯信号应该就能恢复了，这也算是皆大欢喜呀。","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":450},{"type":"charslot","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,0","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"可就算这胡萝卜架有通讯功能，我们村里的人也用不上啊？不管通讯坏没坏我们的日子还是照过，胡萝卜也照晒。","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的村民","text":"但要是修塔对我们的生活没有一点好处，还糟蹋了我们的胡萝卜干……","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":455},{"type":"charslot","id":456},{"type":"text","text":"围观的村民窃窃私语。","id":457},{"type":"text","text":"他们似乎相信了胡萝卜架上的阿纳缇并非可疑人士，但对于收成的执着，让他们不愿轻易交出通讯塔的修理权。","id":458},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"唔……","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":461},{"type":"charslot","id":462},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2355_1#1$1","focus":"l","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":463},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2356_1#1$1","focus":"l","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的村民","text":"哎？今天这儿怎么聚了这么多人？","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2355_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"看戏的村民","text":"喏，上面那个抽鼻子的小姑娘说我们的胡萝卜架不是胡萝卜架，是什么远程通讯塔。","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_2356_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"看戏的村民","text":"眼前的这个沃尔珀小姑娘又说通讯塔修好了虽然对晒胡萝卜没帮助，但能恢复跟周边村镇的通讯。","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_2356_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"看戏的村民","text":"你说，走去邻村也就四十分钟路，哪需要费劲用终端通讯，对吧？","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_2356_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":470},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":471},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":472},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":473},{"type":"charslot","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":475},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2355_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.5","id":476},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":477},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的村民","text":"几位救星——！！！","id":479,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2355_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"欸？","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的村民","text":"这胡萝卜架——啊不，是胡萝卜塔！能不能连上我妻子的老家——芜菁镇的通讯啊！","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2355_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":484},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":485},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":486},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":487},{"type":"charslot","id":488},{"type":"background","id":489},{"type":"image","id":490}],"characters":["安洁莉娜","塔妮","？？？","物资箱？","衣着体面的少女","安洁莉娜&塔妮","嘉辛塔","慌张的少女","愤怒的村民","不满的村民","好事的村民","看戏的村民"]}